{"id":"en_my-stepfather-s-living-doll","title":"My Stepfather’s Living Doll","titleEn":"My Stepfather’s Living Doll","description":"Evelyn notices something strange about her late mother's doll: each time it is touched, she feels the contact on her own skin. Arthur, her intimidating mafia stepfather, keeps his distance during the day yet guards the doll in secret after dark. Once Evelyn grasps that the doll is bound to her, she begins to see the emotions and hidden truths Arthur has kept buried for years. Then the doll disappears, setting off a search across the city that leaves Arthur no choice but to show how deeply he cares.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-stepfathers-living-doll/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-stepfathers-living-doll/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Family Ethics","Plot Twist","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsiao/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-stepfather-s-living-doll_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsiao/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-stepfather-s-living-doll_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsiao/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-stepfather-s-living-doll_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsiao/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-stepfather-s-living-doll_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsiao/?pub=4occ